      "role": "user",
      "content": "so you think the ending should just be... finality? like, he shouldn't try to find a way through it? i guess i just feel like if i write him finding a reason to keep going, it feels dishonest to the character. and honestly, it feels dishonest to how i'm feeling right now too. everything just feels so heavy. if i'm being real with you, i don't see a way for him to win, and i don't really see a way for things to get better for me either. it just feels like the wall is there for a reason.",
